      "dc:source": "communications-legislation-amendment-information-sharing-and-datacasting-act-2007.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nACMA official means:\n\n(a) a member; or\n\n(b) an associate member; or\n\n(c) a member of the ACMA staff; or\n\n(d) a person whose services are made available to the ACMA\nunder subsection 55(1).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nACMA official means:\n\n(a) a member; or\n\n(b) an associate member; or\n\n(c) a member of the ACMA staff; or\n\n(d) a person whose services are made available to the ACMA\nunder subsection 55(1).",
      "cml:asserts": [
