      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Section 3",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nACMA official means:\n\n(a) a member; or\n\n(b) an associate member; or\n\n(c) a member of the ACMA staff; or\n\n(d) a person whose services are made available to the ACMA\nunder subsection 55(1)."
